  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings (e.g., config_018) achieve higher accuracy (0.6186) than singleprofile or rna_only models. This experiment tests replacing ResNet50 with ViT (imagenet_vit_l) and switching from concat to weighted fusion in the same multiprofile setup. It isolates the impact of image encoder architecture and fusion method, which are critical design choices with potential for performance gains. This is a logical extension of the high-performing config_018, balancing exploitation of promising directions with exploration of key components."
